d'\n\n# \u2500\u2500 Split Parity Functions \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500", "line_end": 1200, "line_start": 1195}, {"block_index": 240, "checksum": "1853629452", "data": "# [Reference: https://parchive.sourceforge.net/]\n#\n# AXIOMS:\n# 1. Split parity enables 10% data reco", "line_end": 1205, "line_start": 1200}, {"block_index": 241, "checksum": "1760822601", "data": "# 3. GC parity uses weighted XOR for chunk-level protection\n#\n# THEOREMS:\n# 1. THEOREM: Any 5% data ", "line_end": 1210, "line_start": 1205}, {"block_index": 242, "checksum": "1163964776", "data": "\n\ndef generate_parity(source_path: str, block_size: int = 512) -> dict:\n    try:\n      \"\"\"Generate s", "line_end": 1215, "line_start": 1210}, {"block_index": 243, "checksum": "4034179106", "data": "\n      Creates RS and GC parity blocks with per-part checksums.\n      RS: Reed-Solomon(255,223) enco", "line_end": 1220, "line_start": 1215}, {"block_index": 244, "checksum": "117089957", "data": "      -- AXIOMS --\n      1. Source file is read and split into blocks\n      2. Each block is encoded", "line_end": 1225, "line_start": 1220}, {"block_index": 245, "checksum": "1686257783", "data": "\n      -- CITATIONS --\n      - Reed, I.S. & Solomon, G. (1960) Polynomial Codes over Certain Finite ", "line_end": 1230, "line_start": 1225}, {"block_index": 246, "checksum": "545633936", "data": "\n      Args:\n          source_path: Path to the source file\n          block_size: Size of each parit", "line_end": 1235, "line_start": 1230}, {"block_index": 247, "checksum": "1377373103", "data": "      Returns:\n          dict with rs_parity, gc_parity, source_hash, rs_checksum, gc_checksum\n     ", "line_end": 1240, "line_start": 1235}, {"block_index": 248, "checksum": "287032876", "data": "      import hashlib\n      import json\n      import z